acceptance_criteria: All MCP server registrations use 'pm-mcp'; all plugin dirs and plugin names use pm-claude/pm-codex; all packages use @unbrained/pm-X; marketplace name normalised to pm-local where applicable; full test suite green; smoke tests for both plugins pass; plugin version bumped so existing users pick up rename on next plugin update.
