resolution: Completed naming migration to pm-claude/pm-codex/pm-mcp and @unbrained/pm-* in tracked source surfaces.
expected_result: No active source surface should depend on legacy pm-cli-* or @unbrained/pm-package-* naming.
actual_result: Legacy names remain only in historical tracker artifacts; active runtime/docs/plugin surfaces use unified naming.
